    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check other games</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321630/extras/ecb66863676ef7e26167955852ca9a05.avif?t=1713882636\" /></span><br><br><strong>Animal Jigsaw VR</strong> is a relaxing puzzle game that not only improves your mood, but also increases your knowledge with interesting content about a variety of animals and their habitats.<br><br><strong>Take a deep breath and immerse yourself in nature.</strong><br>Enter the beautiful, sunny savannah to socialize with cheetahs, or listen to the sounds of the trees in a peaceful meadow among deer. &quot;Animal Jigsaw VR&quot; pleasantly surprises with its graphics and faithful representation of animals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321630/extras/1abd5af0f9f26dcf51ca4141338a9242.poster.avif?t=1713882636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321630/extras/1abd5af0f9f26dcf51ca4141338a9242.webm?t=1713882636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321630/extras/1abd5af0f9f26dcf51ca4141338a9242.mp4?t=1713882636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>An adventure you'll return to time and time again.</strong><br>With over a dozen levels of varying difficulty, each with 3D puzzles of varying complexity and quantity, it's the perfect way to beat boredom any time of the year or day. Completing each level allows you to explore a new region and expand your animal collection.<br><br><strong>More than just a game</strong><br>&quot;Animal Jigsaw VR&quot; is not just great fun, it's also educational. Players can learn many new things about different animal species and their environments.<br><br><span cla